install-openwebui.sh	Installs the Open WebUI package into a Podman rootless container using a Quadlet. Run as a user.
install-hermes-agent.sh	Installs the Hermes Agent and Dashboard into a Podman rootless container using a Quadlet. Run as user.
install-openclaw.sh Installs OpenClaw into a Podman rootless container using a quadlet. Run as user.
install-symlinks-ncurses5.sh	Installs symbolic links for compatibility with ncurses 5 apps. Uses sudo.
remove-symlinks-ncurses5.sh	Removes symbolic links for compatibility with ncurses 5 apps.  Uses sudo.
